---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Writing
description: Notes on analytics, project decisions, and making sense of data.
permalink: /writing/
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <header class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Notes from the work</p>
    <h1>A little more depth.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Project walkthroughs, questions worth exploring, and lessons from working with data.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="writing-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <article class="writing-row">
      <div class="writing-meta"><span class="section-label">{{ post.data.category }}</span><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>{% if post.data.example %}<span class="sample-label">Sample article</span>{% endif %}</div>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <span class="reading-time">{{ post.templateContent | readingTime }} min read</span>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% else %}
    <div class="prose"><h2>Notes are on the way.</h2><p>In the meantime, take a look at the <a href="{{ '/projects/' | url }}">project case studies</a>.</p></div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
